 The last decade has changed what is possible. Solutions that were theoretical are now being built, costed, and measured — including here in British Columbia.
 
 This page is about what is working. Some of it is provincial research, some of it is your own municipality's climate plan, and some of it is the global picture. It is a good antidote to the feeling that nothing is being done.
-
-## In British Columbia
-
-- [Articles and reports](https://climatesolutions.ca/articles-reports/) — Pacific Institute for Climate Solutions, University of Victoria — BC-focused research on flood and fire, cost analyses, environmental impacts, and Indigenous involvement.
-- [RegenerateBC](https://regeneratebc.org/) — Research-based solutions to the climate crisis and ways to act on them in BC.
-
-## Your own community
-
-Visit your city or town's website and look for its climate plan. A few strong examples:
-
-- [Climate Emergency Action Plan](https://vancouver.ca/green-vancouver/vancouvers-climate-emergency.aspx) — City of Vancouver
-- [Saanich Climate Plan](https://www.saanich.ca/EN/main/community/sustainable-saanich/saanich-climate-plan.html) — District of Saanich
-- [Green Initiatives](https://www.nanaimo.ca/green-initiatives) — City of Nanaimo
-
-## Across Canada and the world
-
-- [Climate Solutions](https://davidsuzuki.org/our-work/climate-solutions/) — David Suzuki Foundation — An assessment of Canada's climate goals, plans, and problems, including who the major polluters are.
-- [Katharine Hayhoe at the Calgary Climate Summit, 2025](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PisU-yTXLo) — YouTube — A keynote on how today's choices can benefit people, industry, and the planet at once. Her argument: hope is not the absence of fear, it is the courage to act together.
-- [Climate Solutions](https://www.worldenvironmentday.global/2026/latest/climate-solutions) — UN Environment Programme — Ideas for individuals, companies, and governments to tackle climate change.
-- [Project Drawdown](https://drawdown.org) — A leading guide to science-based climate solutions, with current news and analysis.
